\\\\ (0.72)^{3x-7} & \\le -12.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBecause a power of a positive number is always greater than $0,$ we must have\n\n$$\n(0.72)^{3x-7}>0\n$$\n\nfor all values of $x.$\n\nTherefore, the inequality $(0.72)^{3x-7}\\le -12$ has no solutions." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-115230/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a114450f-bfcd-5db3-9060-fcd067c606fa"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-115230"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-87872/selection/f03fb87c0dc4bb46f2eb070673c327355411479c5eb45386114937e5acef71e4" :answer/id #uuid "deeeae5c-3db4-5076-a088-17f188e3f16f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x<-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-87872/selection/2f858f1578dc816ca174bdb4a530c632e01791383d092d73df9d1e413592ddf0" :answer/id #uuid "cf14c630-59ec-500b-a6e9-40ff8c22a4bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x>\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-87872/selection/8f76e462957fb434a3d41a30d4aee7e4d94453f7a9ebe4a2fea4dc30b98d8c81" :answer/id #uuid "b9f0894a-beb1-5ff9-8980-78d2cef5b68f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x<\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-87872/selection/52f8bfd00f6b3deb0e93232df027641f8c16cee0e37ff5f896dd75bd009234e2" :answer/id #uuid "05b54df9-9317-53e0-b380-658da7c278db" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "no solutions" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-87872/selection/12cf5bf844cf95b95e80f529266ac6af4ed60a8ea790e2b44db6283719be635c" :answer/id #uuid "e101ace2-e87c-5a2c-ad48-90ccf9081e9d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "all real numbers" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-87872/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f4bebf12-c808-5950-ab72-aa79531416ce" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-87872/selection/52f8bfd00f6b3deb0e93232df027641f8c16cee0e37ff5f